            "widgets_values": [
              "Z-Image-Turbo is a distilled 8-step model: 8 steps, cfg=1, sampler=res_multistep, scheduler=simple are required, not optional.\nNo negative prompt needed (Z-Image-Turbo is distilled with CFG=1) — ConditioningZeroOut handles that automatically.\nNeeds 3 files: diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors (~12GB), text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors (~8GB), vae/ae.safetensors (~170MB).\nOutput goes to ComfyUI's output/ folder — to feed it into the Wan2.2 image-to-video workflow, use the LoadImage node's upload button (copies it into input/)."
